# Handoff — plugin-manager shipped

**Date**: 2026-07-27
**Branch**: `feature/plugin-manager`
**Last commit**: `8a38b0c` (docs(backlog): mark plugin-manager as SHIPPED)

## What shipped

`@platform/plugin-manager` is fully implemented and tested. 107 behaviour tests pass across 8 test files; build/lint/typecheck/check-banned-types clean.

**Public surface** (async factory):
```ts
import { createPluginManager } from "@platform/plugin-manager";

const pm = await createPluginManager(eventBus, capabilityRegistry, {
  installRecordPath: "./data/installed-plugins.json", // default
  cleanupTimeoutMs: 5000,                            // default
  fs,        // optional FileSystem override (default: Node fs.promises)
  yaml,      // optional YamlParser override (default: yaml@^2.6.0)
  clock,     // optional Clock override (default: system clock)
});
// pm: { install, installFromRegistry, update, reload, disable, enable, uninstall, list, get }
```

The factory performs startup re-install on construction: reads `./data/installed-plugins.json`, re-registers every plugin's capabilities, sets `lastError` on failures (does NOT fire `plugin.installed` on startup).

**Files** (all under 350 lines):
- `packages/plugin-manager/src/types.ts` — public contracts + `YamlValue` recursive type
- `packages/plugin-manager/src/errors.ts` — `ERROR_CODES` (16 constants) + `PluginManagerError`
- `packages/plugin-manager/src/manifest.ts` — `parseManifest` + `validateManifest` + helpers
- `packages/plugin-manager/src/store.ts` — `InstallStore` (in-memory + atomic disk persistence)
- `packages/plugin-manager/src/events.ts` — `EventPublisher` (7 `plugin.*` events)
- `packages/plugin-manager/src/fs.ts` — `nodeFileSystem` (atomic write-temp-then-rename)
- `packages/plugin-manager/src/yaml.ts` — `nodeYamlParser` (wraps `yaml@^2.6.0`)
- `packages/plugin-manager/src/lifecycle-helpers.ts` — shared helpers + `applyManifest` + `PluginManagerContext`
- `packages/plugin-manager/src/lifecycle.ts` — install/update/reload/disable/enable/uninstall/performStartupReinstall
- `packages/plugin-manager/src/index.ts` — thin `createPluginManager` factory

**Test files**: `types.test.ts`, `manifest.test.ts`, `store.test.ts`, `plugin-manager.test.ts`, `update-reload.test.ts`, `disable-enable.test.ts`, `uninstall.test.ts`, `integration.test.ts` — all vitest, real EventBus + CapabilityRegistry, in-memory fakes for FileSystem/Clock/YamlParser.

**Fixtures**: `browser.yaml`, `browser-v2.yaml`, `logging.yaml`, `vscode-helper.yaml`, `collision.yaml`, `malformed.yaml`, `no-type.yaml`, `two-types.yaml`.

